  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsens huvudsakliga m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r att genomf&#xf6;ra den statliga politiken om &#xe5;terb&#xf6;rdande av illegalt f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;rvad mark till &#xe5;terv&#xe4;ndande             internflyktingar och andra offer f&#xf6;r konflikten som omfattas av       best&#xe4;mmelserna om &#xe5;terb&#xf6;rdande av mark i lagen om gottg&#xf6;relse f&#xf6;r     konfliktens offer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of this proposal is: To implement the public    policy of restitution/formalization of lands and territories for      displaced people and other victims of violence that is covered by the section on land restitution in the Law of Victims as part of the      comprehensive land policy of the Ministry of Agriculture and Rural    Development.</narrative>
